From: EmberBSD (AI-assisted)
Subject: Cross-build polkit using native generators and real target introspection

Upstream: https://download.kde.org/stable/polkit-qt-1/polkit-qt-1-0.201.1.tar.xz
SHA256: 95d8e2cae530c546d9437459deb8a1bea38d572f0f9772cc2860dc143637f256

ConsoleKit 2.0 IDs: adapted from Gleb Popov's FreeBSD Ports change
12b84b980b45573c93be5382a274dbe872a1eb73, with ownership declarations corrected.

--- a/security/polkit/Makefile
+++ b/security/polkit/Makefile
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
